# STATE-20260921-004 custody: artifacts/tracking/ is the ignored machine truth
# (data_manifest.json + baseline_stats.json written by 001/002 writers, owned
# by the etl/train steps). The published surface is tracked
# reports/tracking/ (data_card.md + rendered summaries via the report/audit
# renderer pattern) plus MLflow run artifacts on the train run (mlruns/ stays
# local-only). Do NOT add negations for artifacts/tracking/ here.
artifacts/
/results/
project/experiments/results/**
!project/experiments/results/**/
!project/experiments/results/**/*.csv
# The dashboard's answer surface is committed: the decision record, its report,
# and the figure a human reads (EXPERIMENT_OUTPUT.md).
!project/experiments/results/**/*_decision.json
# The per-feature evidence written next to the singular summary record.
!project/experiments/results/**/*_feature_decisions.json
# The selected/tuned champion handoff (model + params + CV interval).
!project/experiments/results/**/*_champion.json
!project/experiments/results/**/*.md
*.png
!reports/figures/*.png
!project/experiments/results/**/*.png
graphify-out/
